.TH strlist_fromb 3
.SH NAME
strlist_fromb \- populate string list from buffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "strlist.h"
.PP
.BI "void strlist_fromb(strlist *" sl ", const char *" x ", size_t " n ", const char *" delim ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B strlist_fromb
populates the string list
.I sl
by parsing the buffer
.I x
of length
.I n
using the delimiter string
.IR delim .